meta {
  name: 18 Route Planning
  seq: 18
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  POST /api/v1/Routes/plan finds a route over the lane network (read-only).
  Test network (all Asia/Bangkok), goods ready Friday 2026-10-02 15:00:

  Bangna branch -(on demand, 1 h, 25 km)-> Lat Krabang hub, then three ways to Chiang Mai hub:
  - via Nakhon Sawan: 22:00 daily (4 h, 240 km), then 03:00 Mon/Wed/Fri/Sun only (5 h, 330 km)
  - via Phitsanulok: 20:00 daily (5.5 h, 380 km), then 06:00 daily (4.5 h, 300 km)
  - rail: 18:00 daily (18 h, 750 km)
  then Chiang Mai hub -(courier on demand, 40 min, 12 km)-> Chiang Mai branch.

  Fastest = via Phitsanulok (arrives Sat 11:10), Shortest = via Nakhon Sawan (607 km,
  but waits for Sunday's 03:00 departure), LowestEmissions = rail.
}
